         <COLUMN NAME="CMMNT_TX" TYPE="CHAR" PK="NO"  NULL="NO">build 09.14.04.1 - "Customer" Higlight datatype changed to "STRING"

The main objective of this pattern is to find focal entities (INSTRUCTIONS) with instruction risk level greater or equal to the scenario risk threshold value and which attribute values are checked with Orion scenario library parameters.

This pattern consists of a single rule -- Primary Rule. The Primary Rule creates a set of instructions with its risk level attribute value greater or equal to the scenario risk threshold value.

All records in the dataset produced with Primary Rule are liable to the alert generation. Focus clustering check box of the Primary Rule is checked on.
</COLUMN>
